message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Crisis Management Multi-Agent System: Graph Attention Networks and Evidential Reasoning for Emergency Response Coordination"
version: 1.5
date-released: 2026-07-05
authors:
  - family-names: Kazoukas
    given-names: Vasileios
    email: kazoukas@gmail.com
    affiliation: Technical University of Crete - Military Academy
