repository-code: "https://github.com/kerbgr/CrisisMAS"
url: "https://github.com/kerbgr/CrisisMAS"
abstract: >
  A multi-agent system for crisis management and emergency response coordination
  using Graph Attention Networks (GAT) and Evidential Reasoning (ER) for belief
  aggregation across 13 specialized expert agents. The system supports Greek
  emergency services including fire brigades, police, coast guard, medical services,
  and environmental experts in multi-agency decision-making during natural disasters,
  industrial accidents, and complex emergency scenarios.
keywords:
  - multi-agent systems
  - crisis management
  - emergency response
  - graph attention networks
  - evidential reasoning
  - decision support systems
  - Greek emergency services
  - TOPSIS
  - belief aggregation
  - consensus building
